  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 1001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 1001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish the requirements and process for registering and renewing registrations for legally existing docking structures in non-tidal waters in order to exempt the repair and replacement of such structures from the permitting requirements of RSA 482-A:3.\n\nSource. #13210, INTERIM, eff 6-15-21; ss by #13314, eff 12-21-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt1000.html"
}
